                                "sense_id": "43d99666-0537-3b8d-8f6c-5a678f11e35c",
                                "text": "[274] Hence the Western Islanders of Torres Straits form a transition both geographically and ethnographically between the aborigines of Australia on the one side and the aborigines of New Guinea on the other side."
