                                "sense_id": "43d99666-0537-3b8d-8f6c-5a678f11e35c",
                                "text": "Straws are just one of the unconventional but commonplace items Dohner uses in addition to traditional materials like ceramic, glass, and wood in his series of witty, ethnographically inspired works now on view at Ten in One Gallery."
